    70	|---|---|
    71	| [STATUS.md](STATUS.md) | literature status and SOTA with primary sources; what is open; baseline |
    72	| [RESULTS.md](RESULTS.md) | claims, proofs, evidence labels, verification commands, review dispositions |
    73	| `code/fpc_core.py` | exact polynomial (Bargmann/Fock) engine for spin-f bosons (python-flint rationals) |
    74	| `code/spin2_basis.py`, `code/spin2_tables.py` | spin-2 covariant basis (f, H, T, j); exact reduced-CFP tables |
    75	| `code/top_family_symbolic.py` | symbolic-in-v (and in f) derivation in deficit coordinates (Theorems B, C) |
    76	| `code/check_seniority_factorization.py` | Theorem A and Bao–Li, exact |
    77	| `code/check_general_f.py`, `code/general_f_k4.py` | Theorems B, B', E1 against the numeric engine; square classes for f = 3, 4, 5 |
    78	| `code/multiplicity_obstruction.py`, `code/brauer_residues.py` | Gram data, square classes, residue (Brauer) analysis (Theorem D) |
    79	| `code/verify_bottom_conjectures.py` | Conjecture E2 against exact tables |
    80	| `code/compare_pan2014.py` | reproduction of Pan et al. 2014 Tables III–IV |
    81	| `code/selftest.py`, `code/verify_first_quantized.py`, `code/verify_two_body.py` | engine self-tests; independent first-quantized recomputation of one- and two-body CFPs |
    82	| `results/` | exact tables (JSON, rationals as strings) and symbolic outputs (txt) |
