   315	
   316	* `$PY selftest.py`: `selftest OK: 462 exact checks passed`. These cover [P,P†] = 4N̂+2D,
   317	  S₊ commuting with P and P†, adjointness, idempotence and orthogonality of the harmonic projector,
   318	  [S₊,S₋] = 2S_z, and the stretched CG formula against sympy.
   319	* `$PY verify_first_quantized.py`: `first-quantized check OK: 74 CFPs (f=1 N<=5, f=2 N<=4, f=3 N<=3)
   320	  agree with the engine, including signs`. This is an independent definition-level computation with
   321	  explicit symmetric tensors and sympy CG coefficients.
   322	* Multiplicity labels agree with the null-space dimension for every (v, L), v ≤ 14
