   328	
   329	With the pair φ_s(N−1, N) coupled first and C2 defined by
   330	|N; ΓL⟩ = Σ C2(ΓL; s, Γ''L'') [φ_s ⊗ |N−2; Γ''L''⟩]_L, the standard chain formula
   331	
   332	  C2(ΓL; s, Γ''L'') = Σ_{Γ'L'} c(ΓL; Γ'L') c(Γ'L'; Γ''L'') (−1)^{L+L''} √((2s+1)(2L'+1)) {f f s; L'' L L'}
